{"seq":3,"slug":"desulfurization-denitrification","title":"大学环境工程 — 气态污染物治理：烟气脱硫与脱硝","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/air-pollution-control/desulfurization-denitrification","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学环境工程-气态污染物治理-烟气脱硫与脱硝\">大学环境工程 — 气态污染物治理：烟气脱硫与脱硝</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>颗粒物可以靠物理手段&quot;抓&quot;下来，但气态污染物（如 SO₂ 和 NOₓ）是溶解在烟气中的分子，无法过滤，只能通过<strong>化学反应</strong>把它们转化或固定。这正是烟气脱硫（去除 SO₂）和脱硝（去除 NOₓ）的核心思路——用化学的办法，让有害气体变成无害或可回收的物质。</p>\n<p>SO₂ 是酸雨的主要元凶，主要来自燃煤；NOₓ 既导致酸雨，又是光化学烟雾和臭氧的前体，主要来自高温燃烧。这两项技术是现代燃煤电厂实现&quot;超低排放&quot;的关键，也是中国近十年大气治理成效的技术支柱。理解它们，就理解了一座现代电厂烟囱&quot;变干净&quot;的化学奥秘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"烟气脱硫-fgd-石灰石-石膏法\">烟气脱硫（FGD）：石灰石—石膏法</h3><p>脱硫技术种类很多，但全球应用最广、占据绝对主流的是<strong>石灰石—石膏湿法脱硫（WFGD）</strong>。它的原理是用石灰石浆液吸收烟气中的 SO₂，最终产物是工业石膏——一种可以回收利用的副产品。核心反应可概括为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CaCO_3 + SO_2 + \\frac{1}{2}O_2 + 2H_2O \\rightarrow CaSO_4 \\cdot 2H_2O + CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上，烟气从底部进入<strong>吸收塔</strong>，与从顶部喷淋下来的石灰石浆液逆流接触，SO₂ 被浆液吸收并发生反应。塔底鼓入空气把亚硫酸钙氧化为硫酸钙（石膏），脱硫后的洁净烟气从塔顶排出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[含SO₂烟气] --&gt; B[吸收塔底部进气]&#10;    C[石灰石浆液] --&gt; D[塔顶喷淋]&#10;    B --&gt; E[逆流接触&lt;br/&gt;SO₂被吸收]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[洁净烟气出塔]&#10;    E --&gt; G[塔底氧化&lt;br/&gt;生成石膏]&#10;    G --&gt; H[石膏回收]\">graph TD\n    A[含SO₂烟气] --&gt; B[吸收塔底部进气]\n    C[石灰石浆液] --&gt; D[塔顶喷淋]\n    B --&gt; E[逆流接触&lt;br/&gt;SO₂被吸收]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[洁净烟气出塔]\n    E --&gt; G[塔底氧化&lt;br/&gt;生成石膏]\n    G --&gt; H[石膏回收]</pre><p>衡量脱硫系统的关键指标是<strong>钙硫比（Ca/S）<strong>和</strong>脱硫效率</strong>。钙硫比是投加的钙（石灰石）与待脱除的硫的摩尔比，理论值为 1，实际为保证反应充分通常取 1.02–1.05。湿法脱硫效率可达 95%–99%，是燃煤电厂的标配。它的优点是效率高、技术成熟、副产物可利用；缺点是系统庞大、耗水、产生废水需处理。</p>\n<p>除湿法外还有半干法（喷雾干燥）和干法（炉内喷钙），它们不产生废水、占地小，但效率较低，多用于中小锅炉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"烟气脱硝-scr-与-sncr\">烟气脱硝：SCR 与 SNCR</h3><p>脱硝的主流技术是<strong>选择性催化还原（SCR）<strong>和</strong>选择性非催化还原（SNCR）</strong>。两者的化学本质相同——都是用氨（NH₃）或尿素作为还原剂，把 NOₓ 还原成无害的氮气和水：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>催化剂</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4NO + 4NH_3 + O_2 \\xrightarrow{\\text{催化剂}} 4N_2 + 6H_2O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">催化剂</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>区别在于<strong>有没有催化剂</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>SCR</th>\n<th>SNCR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否用催化剂</td>\n<td>是（钒钛系催化剂）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反应温度</td>\n<td>300–400℃</td>\n<td>850–1100℃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱硝效率</td>\n<td>80–90%</td>\n<td>30–50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资</td>\n<td>高（催化剂昂贵）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>大型电厂</td>\n<td>中小锅炉、改造</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SCR</strong> 在催化剂作用下，反应能在 300–400℃ 这个相对温和的温度区间高效进行，脱硝效率高达 90%，是大型电厂的首选。它的成本主要在催化剂——钒钛系催化剂价格昂贵且会逐渐失活、需要更换，这是 SCR 的主要运行负担。催化剂的安装位置（高尘、低尘还是尾部）也是一门设计学问。</p>\n<p><strong>SNCR</strong> 不用催化剂，直接把还原剂喷入炉膛 850–1100℃ 的高温区让反应自发进行。它投资低、改造简单，但效率较低（30–50%），且温度窗口很窄——温度过低反应不完全，过高则氨自身被氧化反而生成更多 NOₓ。因此 SNCR 多用于对脱硝要求不高的中小锅炉，或与 SCR 联合使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"协同治理与超低排放\">协同治理与超低排放</h3><p>现代燃煤电厂把除尘、脱硫、脱硝集成在一条烟气净化线上，典型顺序是：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>锅炉 → SCR 脱硝 → 空预器 → 电除尘 → 脱硫塔 → 湿式电除尘 → 烟囱</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这个顺序不是随意的：SCR 要求较高温度，所以放在最前（紧接锅炉）；脱硫在湿法环境中进行，放在除尘之后避免堵塞；末端再加湿式电除尘进一步抓住脱硫带出的细微液滴和气溶胶。经过全套处理，燃煤电厂可实现&quot;超低排放&quot;——烟尘、SO₂、NOₓ 排放浓度甚至低于天然气电厂的标准。中国数亿千瓦的燃煤机组在 2014–2020 年间完成了这一改造，是这套技术体系最大规模的工程验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么气态污染物（SO₂、NOₓ）不能像颗粒物那样用过滤或静电去除，而必须依靠化学反应？</li>\n<li>写出石灰石—石膏法脱硫的总反应，并说明为什么钙硫比通常略大于 1 而不是恰好等于 1。</li>\n<li>SCR 和 SNCR 的化学本质相同，最大区别是什么？这个区别如何影响它们的反应温度、效率和成本？</li>\n<li>为什么在整条烟气净化线中，SCR 脱硝放在最前、脱硫塔放在除尘之后？请从温度和湿度的角度解释这个排序逻辑。</li>\n<li>&quot;超低排放&quot;的燃煤电厂排放为何能低于天然气标准？这说明末端治理技术的潜力还是局限？谈谈你的看法。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《大气污染控制工程》（郝吉明等）脱硫脱硝章节——反应机理与系统设计的权威讲解</li>\n<li>了解中国&quot;燃煤电厂超低排放&quot;政策（2015 年起）及其工程规模，体会政策与技术的互动</li>\n<li>查阅一家大型电厂的环保数据公示牌（多在厂区门口实时显示 SO₂、NOₓ、烟尘排放），把课本数字与现实对照</li>\n<li>钒钛系 SCR 催化剂的&quot;中毒&quot;与再生——理解为什么催化剂是 SCR 全生命周期成本的关键</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>气态污染物治理的核心是用化学反应转化有害气体。烟气脱硫以石灰石—石膏湿法为主流，把 SO₂ 转化为可回收的石膏，效率达 95% 以上，钙硫比是关键参数。脱硝用氨/尿素作还原剂把 NOₓ 还原为氮气，SCR（有催化剂、高效、高成本）与 SNCR（无催化剂、低效、低成本）各有适用场景。现代电厂把除尘、脱硫、脱硝按温度湿度逻辑串联，实现超低排放。至此大气污染控制告一段落。下一章我们转向第三种环境介质——固体废物，看垃圾从产生到最终归宿的全过程。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学环境工程 — 气态污染物治理：烟气脱硫与脱硝","id":"大学环境工程-气态污染物治理-烟气脱硫与脱硝"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"烟气脱硫（FGD）：石灰石—石膏法","id":"烟气脱硫-fgd-石灰石-石膏法"},{"level":3,"text":"烟气脱硝：SCR 与 SNCR","id":"烟气脱硝-scr-与-sncr"},{"level":3,"text":"协同治理与超低排放","id":"协同治理与超低排放"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 颗粒物控制：除尘技术原理与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/air-pollution-control/particulate-control"},"next":{"title":"大学环境工程 — 固体废物的分类、特性与\"三化\"原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/environmental-engineering/solid-waste-treatment/solid-waste-fundamentals"}}